'''Juggler''' (Japanese: '''ジャグラー''' ''Juggler'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=You can use this card only if your Pokémon in play have 3 or more different types of Energy attached.

Move all Energy from each of your Benched Pokémon to your Active Pokémon.
}}

