* {{TCG|Juggler}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.
===Origin===
*{{tc|Juggler}} is a Trainer class introduced to the [[core series]] games in [[Generation I]].
*This card's artwork features the Juggler's appearance from {{game|HeartGold and SoulSilver|s}}.

